Maintainer: gbnanoengineer <gbnanoengineer@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Lightweight all-in-one messenger hub (WhatsApp, Slack, Discord, Gmail, ...)
 One window for many web services, each instance with its own isolated login:
 several WhatsApps (linked-device QR login), Gmails, Outlooks, Telegram, Slack,
 Discord, Teams, Messenger and custom sites. Uses the current Chromium
 (Qt WebEngine), downloaded into your home folder at install time and kept up
 to date automatically. Calls, video and screen sharing, shared download
 manager, tray, per-app notifications, dark/light theme, custom CSS/JS.
 Unofficial; not affiliated with any of these services.
